# Component System & Layout Patterns

## Reusable Components

### 1. ServiceShowcase Component

**Location:** [ServiceShowcase.tsx](mdc:src/components/ServiceShowcase.tsx)

**Purpose:** Display services, features, or items in a consistent grid layout with cards.

**Usage:**

```tsx
<ServiceShowcase
  title="Our Core Solutions"
  description="Description text"
  background="default"
  columns={3}
  items={[
    {
      icon: "🎯",
      title: "Service Title",
      description: "Short description",
      features: ["Feature 1", "Feature 2"],
      buttonText: "Learn More",
      buttonHref: "/path",
    },
  ]}
/>
```

### 2. ContentSection Component

**Location:** [ContentSection.tsx](mdc:src/components/ContentSection.tsx)

**Purpose:** Display text-heavy content sections with consistent styling. Uses `text-base` for body text.

**Usage:**

```tsx
<ContentSection
  badge="SECTION BADGE"
  title="Section Title"
  maxWidth="4xl"
  buttons={[
    { text: "Primary Action", href: "/path" },
    { text: "Secondary", href: "/other", variant: "outline" },
  ]}
>
  <p>
    Content with <strong>emphasis</strong>.
  </p>
</ContentSection>
```

### 3. QuoteSection Component

**Location:** [QuoteSection.tsx](mdc:src/components/QuoteSection.tsx)

**Purpose:** Display quotes with attribution.

**Usage:**

```tsx
<QuoteSection
  quote="The quote text here."
  author="Author Name"
  role="Job Title"
  organization="Company Name"
/>
```

### 4. CTASection Component

**Location:** [CTASection.tsx](mdc:src/components/CTASection.tsx)

**Purpose:** Call-to-action sections with optional social links. Add `mb-16` when used as last section.

**Usage:**

```tsx
<CTASection
  title="QUESTIONS?"
