## Layout Standards

### Standard Section Wrapper

```tsx
<section className="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">{/* Content */}</section>
```

### Background Variants

**CRITICAL: Use standardized classes from `globals.css`, never inline opacity modifiers**

```tsx
// Muted background (50% opacity)
<section className="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 bg-section-muted">

// Subtle background (30% opacity)
<section className="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 bg-section-subtle">

// Accent background (10% opacity)
<section className="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 bg-section-accent">

// No background
<section className="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">
```

## Spacing Standards

- **Section padding**: `py-16` (4rem top/bottom)
- **Page container spacing**: `space-y-16` (4rem between sections)
- **Content spacing**: `space-y-4` or `space-y-6` (1rem or 1.5rem between paragraphs)
- **Button groups**: `gap-4`
- **Grid gaps**: `gap-8`
- **Footer spacing**: Add `mb-16` to the last section on a page

## Typography Scale

```tsx
// Hero heading
<h1 className="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold">

// Section heading
<h2 className="text-3xl font-bold">

// Subsection heading
<h3 className="text-2xl font-semibold">

// Card title
<h3 className="text-xl font-semibold">

// Large body text (hero descriptions)
<p className="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">

// Standard body text (default for ContentSection)
<p className="text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">

// Small text (metadata, captions)
<p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
```

## Grid Layouts

```tsx
// 3-column grid (desktop)
<div className="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">

// 2-column grid (desktop)
<div className="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">

// 4-column grid (desktop)
<div className="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
```

## Data-Driven Content

### Location

All content data files are in [src/lib/content/](mdc:src/lib/content/):

- `services-data.ts` - Homepage services
- `healthcare-projects.ts` - Homepage projects
- `quotes-data.ts` - Founder quotes
- `social-links-data.tsx` - Social media links
- `services-page-data.ts` - Services page content
- `workshops-page-data.ts` - Workshops page content
- `about-page-data.ts` - About page content
- `contact-page-data.ts` - Contact page content

### Data File Pattern

```typescript
// 1. Define TypeScript Interfaces
export interface Service {
  icon: string;
  title: string;
  description: string;
  features: string[];
  buttonText?: string;
  buttonHref?: string;
}

// 2. Export Data Objects
export const services: Service[] = [
  {
    icon: "🎯",
    title: "AI Consulting",
    description: "Strategic guidance",
    features: ["Feature 1", "Feature 2"],
    buttonText: "Learn More",
    buttonHref: "/services",
  },
];

// 3. Use in Components
import { services } from "@/lib/content/services-data";

export default function HomePage() {
  return <ServiceShowcase items={services} />;
}
```

